# Browser
# Dawnhand Dissident in the browser: its "{T}, Blight 2: Exile target card from a graveyard" is activated on Bot1's Llanowar Elves in its
# graveyard, and the creature to blight is asked as blight is ("choose a creature you control to blight"). The Elves in exile say how
# they may be cast ("Cast by removing three counters from among creatures you control"), and casting them asks which counters to remove
# under a caption that says so: a button for each kind of counter on each creature, naming how many are taken of how many there are,
# and a button that removes them once there are three. Bot1 takes both -1/-1 counters off its Sylvan Caryatid and the +1/+1 counter off
# its Walking Ballista, which dies (CR 704.5f).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Dawnhand Dissident
Llanowar Elves
Walking Ballista
Sylvan Caryatid
Mox Emerald
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
